WEBVTT

00:15.200 --> 00:16.490
<i>Breaking news!</i>

00:18.740 --> 00:24.620
<i>The shock that assaulted Snowfield last night
must be fresh on all your minds.</i>

00:25.040 --> 00:28.420
<i>The huge explosion in the desert area
just south of the city...</i>

00:28.710 --> 00:31.510
<i>was due to a gas company accident...</i>

00:31.510 --> 00:34.590
<i>according to reports this morning
from the Snowfield Police Department.</i>

00:35.510 --> 00:40.680
<i>To investigate the cause of the accident,
all transit routes to the desert have been closed.</i>

00:40.680 --> 00:44.770
<i>All airspace traffic over the area
has also been restricted by the army.</i>

00:49.060 --> 00:51.900
So, this is the flare to signal
the commencement.

00:52.280 --> 00:54.610
Really, the next seven days...

00:55.360 --> 00:58.070
will surely be nauseatingly fun.

01:29.310 --> 01:30.360
Um...

01:31.480 --> 01:32.610
Huh?

01:33.610 --> 01:35.360
Are there...

01:35.360 --> 01:37.990
any cheap motels
around here?

01:42.080 --> 01:43.700
You must be new around here.

01:44.200 --> 01:45.290
Traveling?

01:46.040 --> 01:47.830
Oh, y-yes.

01:48.330 --> 01:49.630
From Japan.

01:50.040 --> 01:51.920
Oh, Japan?

01:51.920 --> 01:54.630
That's a real interesting place!

01:54.630 --> 01:57.300
My dad once went to Japan.

01:57.760 --> 02:00.720
He got me a souvenir from some amusement park
called "Kitsy Land" or something.

02:00.720 --> 02:02.890
It's still at my parents' place!

02:03.680 --> 02:06.060
What part of Japan are you from?

02:06.480 --> 02:08.020
Oh, um...

02:10.230 --> 02:11.230
Wait.

02:11.900 --> 02:13.610
Where was it?

02:13.610 --> 02:15.280
What's up with that?

02:15.610 --> 02:19.320
Well, you can sometimes forget
where you were born.

02:21.200 --> 02:23.450
That's a sick tattoo!

02:25.120 --> 02:26.200
Oh, no.

02:26.830 --> 02:27.960
It's not much.

02:29.870 --> 02:30.830
<i>Sajyou...</i>

02:32.840 --> 02:34.880
<i>Ayaka Sajyou...</i>

02:36.590 --> 02:39.090
<i>Participate in the Holy Grail War...</i>

02:40.010 --> 02:42.180
<i>Ayaka Sajyou.</i>

02:44.850 --> 02:46.390
This again?

02:46.850 --> 02:49.100
Choppers have been flying nonstop
since this morning.

02:49.690 --> 02:51.940
They're getting in the way
of business! Jeez!

02:53.980 --> 02:55.190
From this morning?

02:55.520 --> 02:59.530
Seems some gas tank or pipeline
in the desert blew up last night.

03:00.320 --> 03:02.700
They said it's dangerous,
so the place is off-limits.

03:18.840 --> 03:19.720
This is...

03:21.050 --> 03:22.340
a Command Spell?

03:22.720 --> 03:24.010
Director Faldeus...

03:25.640 --> 03:27.010
Who is this woman?

03:27.350 --> 03:29.640
I wonder who she is.

03:30.890 --> 03:34.440
For a Mage, she doesn't hide
her Magical Energy.

03:34.860 --> 03:38.610
She may be taunting us,
but it's not like she's noticed our surveillance.

03:39.740 --> 03:42.610
Hopefully she doesn't turn out
to be an obstacle for us.

03:44.780 --> 03:47.740
Did you find out anything
about the incident at the desert?

03:47.740 --> 03:49.660
No, not yet. However...

03:50.410 --> 03:56.250
all the familiars that we found comatose
have strange bruises showing up.

03:57.710 --> 03:58.800
Our analysts believe...

03:59.210 --> 04:01.800
it is some kind of illness or a curse.

04:02.470 --> 04:08.640
In any case, we should assume something
related to the Holy Grail War is the cause.

04:09.310 --> 04:11.020
Flat Escardos...

04:11.850 --> 04:12.980
Tiné Chelc...

04:13.770 --> 04:16.310
and a Silver Wolf believed to be a Chimera.

04:17.360 --> 04:19.150
We have ascertained four Masters...

04:19.150 --> 04:21.320
including the police chief.

04:21.690 --> 04:24.530
Three humans and one animal, to be precise.

04:25.530 --> 04:27.910
There were signs that Jester Caltoolet,
a Master candidate...

04:28.200 --> 04:31.410
succeeded in summoning a Heroic Spirit.

04:31.700 --> 04:32.660
However...

04:32.660 --> 04:35.210
multiple skeletal remains
were found in the workshop...

04:35.210 --> 04:37.000
and we don't know if he's alive or dead.

04:37.330 --> 04:38.590
The Kuruoka couple...

04:38.880 --> 04:43.420
refused to participate in the Holy Grail War
to begin with. Absurd behavior.

04:44.470 --> 04:48.300
It is unthinkable considering
what the Kuruoka couple is like.

04:50.850 --> 04:56.350
With so many irregulars, it's difficult
to neatly set everything up. I'm at a loss.

04:59.690 --> 05:01.230
Please register her...

05:01.530 --> 05:03.690
as a Level 2 observation target.

05:04.070 --> 05:05.650
What about Chief Orlando?

05:05.650 --> 05:06.860
We will find a good opportunity...

05:07.450 --> 05:12.160
to share this information with the police chief
along with that of Flat and Silver Wolf.

05:12.700 --> 05:14.620
Concealing a Holy Grail War...

05:15.290 --> 05:17.880
isn't an easy job.

05:29.260 --> 05:30.720
Who'd have thought...

05:30.720 --> 05:34.930
we'd see a time where the United States
would be hosting a Holy Grail War?

05:35.850 --> 05:39.270
I still don't want to believe it...

05:39.860 --> 05:42.860
Lord El-Melloi II.

05:43.730 --> 05:47.070
My sympathies, Mr. Langal.

05:48.160 --> 05:50.200
The one that forced you into that guise...

05:50.200 --> 05:51.780
Faldeus!

05:52.490 --> 05:54.660
He pretended to be my apprentice.

05:54.660 --> 05:56.370
I fell right for his deception!

05:56.710 --> 05:59.750
But in a way, it is very much Mage-like to do so.

06:00.540 --> 06:03.210
Apprentices are supposed to usurp
their mentors, right?

06:03.920 --> 06:05.970
Right, indeed.

06:06.300 --> 06:09.300
And what is their... the States' objective...

06:09.300 --> 06:13.850
for starting a Holy Grail War?

06:14.520 --> 06:17.230
If it was merely a desire
for a Holy Grail...

06:17.230 --> 06:20.060
there was no need
to go out of the way to publicize this.

06:20.690 --> 06:21.690
I definitely...

06:22.190 --> 06:25.820
would love to hear the opinion of you, Lord,
the pride of the Clock Tower.

06:27.900 --> 06:30.950
For this Holy Grail War, there are multiple...

06:31.820 --> 06:35.410
or at least, there is a faction that wishes
to conceal information and a faction...

06:35.410 --> 06:37.080
that wants widespread
dissemination. Both of which...

06:37.080 --> 06:39.080
are weaving in and out of sight
behind the scenes.

06:40.170 --> 06:44.090
You mean the States are not in solidarity?

06:44.590 --> 06:50.470
There is a syndicate that is treating the manifestation
of the Holy Grail not as the objective but a checkpoint.

06:51.640 --> 06:52.800
Either that...

06:53.300 --> 06:56.680
or they are trying to stabilize...

06:56.680 --> 06:59.940
and mass-produce
the Holy Grail War system itself.

07:02.020 --> 07:09.030
The objective of that advertisement
may have been to gather many Mages in Snowfield.

07:09.400 --> 07:10.240
All so...

07:10.700 --> 07:14.740
they can analyze the structure
of the Holy Grail War.

07:15.080 --> 07:16.240
Preposterous!

07:16.660 --> 07:18.330
They want Mages other than themselves...

07:18.950 --> 07:22.830
to analyze a miracle
on par with the Third Magic?

07:23.380 --> 07:24.880
Indeed...

07:24.880 --> 07:26.420
this is unthinkable for Mages...

07:27.090 --> 07:31.720
who seek to arrive at the Root individually
like us here at the Clock Tower.

07:32.130 --> 07:34.550
However, those that delve deep into Mystics...

07:34.550 --> 07:38.680
may harbor ideas different
than those of our orthodoxy.

07:39.810 --> 07:41.480
When you put it to words...

07:41.980 --> 07:44.900
it sounds quite more convincing, Lord.

07:45.520 --> 07:49.070
I do have difficulties
dealing with my apprentices, as well.

07:51.320 --> 07:54.160
In any case, we still lack the pieces...

07:54.660 --> 07:56.870
to comprehend the entire picture.

07:56.870 --> 08:03.460
Faldeus mentioned that there won't be
a Saber-class Servant in this Holy Grail War...

08:04.710 --> 08:06.540
What is clear...

08:06.540 --> 08:09.960
is that anything and everything
is irregular.

08:10.760 --> 08:16.680
It is even doubtful they intend to carry out
an actual Holy Grail War at all.

08:17.930 --> 08:19.640
And while I wouldn't call it speculation...

08:20.470 --> 08:23.100
so much as a foreboding feeling
or hunch.

08:23.770 --> 08:26.150
And I hate to think...

08:26.150 --> 08:28.070
this is what is going on...

08:30.900 --> 08:33.150
but it's like there are people out there...

08:33.150 --> 08:37.450
trying to undermine this war
and turn it into some kind of game or show.

08:43.000 --> 08:43.960
Here ya go.

08:44.710 --> 08:47.290
I wrote up a few recommendations...

08:47.290 --> 08:50.050
though I make no guarantees
of whether you'll like them or not!

08:50.380 --> 08:52.010
Thank you very much.

08:52.760 --> 08:53.670
Um...

08:54.510 --> 08:58.550
Do any of these come equipped
with an elevator?

08:58.550 --> 08:59.720
An elevator?

09:00.100 --> 09:02.060
No place that fancy—

09:02.060 --> 09:04.140
No, never mind.

09:04.520 --> 09:06.730
Thank you very much. Really.

09:08.810 --> 09:09.980
Hey, hey, hey!

09:10.270 --> 09:12.820
All things said, this is way too much, missie!

09:15.240 --> 09:15.990
It's fine.

09:16.780 --> 09:19.740
I probably can't spend it all anyway.

09:34.170 --> 09:35.470
Found you.

09:43.020 --> 09:45.480
<i>Hey, Brother! It's a great morning!</i>

09:47.270 --> 09:50.900
I will have a state-of-the-art clock
delivered to your room later.

09:51.610 --> 09:54.070
<i>Continue your work, Caster.</i>

09:55.860 --> 09:57.320
Now, listen.

09:57.820 --> 10:02.240
While we're at it, tell me at least
one local specialty dish of this country.

10:02.540 --> 10:05.080
I don't care how expensive it is, okay? 'Cause...

10:05.080 --> 10:07.580
<i>I'm not the one that's gonna be paying after all!</i>

10:09.540 --> 10:11.500
I apologize about last night.

10:12.130 --> 10:14.510
There is something I'd like to ask, as well.

10:14.510 --> 10:16.010
What do you think...

10:16.590 --> 10:18.470
about the incident in the desert?

10:20.430 --> 10:21.510
Huh?

10:21.510 --> 10:22.760
What's that?

10:23.060 --> 10:24.930
Did something happen out in the desert?

10:30.020 --> 10:34.480
I was a fool to expect insight
as a Heroic Spirit from you.

10:35.150 --> 10:37.280
Don't call me ever again.

10:37.280 --> 10:39.610
I will call you when I need anything.

10:39.610 --> 10:42.120
<i>Come on! Wait up, hold on!</i>

10:42.450 --> 10:45.830
Are you this indifferent
with that girl named Francesca, too...

10:46.120 --> 10:47.290
<i>Brother?</i>

10:48.210 --> 10:49.370
What?

10:50.080 --> 10:52.000
Or... you know...

10:52.000 --> 10:56.550
are the things that boy Faldeus talks about
easier to understand for ya?

10:56.550 --> 11:01.050
Shall we have a grand ol' time talking
about those Japanese friends of yours named Kuruoka?

11:01.510 --> 11:03.260
How the hell do you—

11:03.260 --> 11:05.010
<i>Don't worry.</i>

11:05.010 --> 11:07.430
<i>I haven't linked your five senses
to me or anything.</i>

11:08.560 --> 11:10.640
This era's very convenient!

11:10.640 --> 11:13.150
As long as you have
the internet and a phone...

11:13.150 --> 11:16.980
you can make anything happen
even from this sandbox.

11:17.820 --> 11:18.990
A Noble Phantasm...

11:19.320 --> 11:24.700
You thought I wouldn't be able to use
modern gadgets because I'm a Servant?

11:25.200 --> 11:27.040
<i>For instance... let's see...</i>

11:27.040 --> 11:31.920
<i>How about I make a phone call
to this girl named Tiné Chelc?</i>

11:31.920 --> 11:36.880
<i>Then, there's our police chief Orlando Reeve,
a guy popular with his underlings...</i>

11:36.880 --> 11:42.840
<i>and all buddy-buddy with shady masterminds
like Francesca and Faldeus.</i>

11:43.140 --> 11:47.310
<i>Faldeus is one of the guys
that set up this Grail War...</i>

11:47.930 --> 11:50.640
and there are many spies
that have infiltrated your syndicate—

11:50.640 --> 11:51.560
Hold it!

11:51.940 --> 11:53.350
Any further and you...

11:53.770 --> 11:56.440
You're scared of wiretapping, aren't you?

11:57.110 --> 12:01.820
Someone might be listening in
electronically or with Magecraft.

12:02.450 --> 12:06.910
<i>You'd be in a bind if I mouthed off
any more than I already have, right?</i>

12:08.290 --> 12:09.290
I see.

12:10.290 --> 12:12.500
Let me give a sincere apology.

12:12.830 --> 12:16.130
It seems I have underestimated you quite a bit...

12:16.500 --> 12:17.750
<i>Caster.</i>

12:17.750 --> 12:20.460
What's gotten into you now? It's creepy.

12:21.220 --> 12:23.800
I'm saying I understand what your abilities are.

12:24.470 --> 12:27.220
<i>Though, if you continue to run your mouth...</i>

12:27.850 --> 12:29.600
I have my own set of plans.

12:29.970 --> 12:32.980
<i>Oh? Gonna make me zip it
with a Command Spell?</i>

12:33.310 --> 12:37.190
Instead of wasting part of that thing
you can only use thrice...

12:37.900 --> 12:41.690
there's another way
if you want me to put a sock in it.

12:42.700 --> 12:44.360
What do you want?

12:44.360 --> 12:46.160
<i>I told you, Brother.</i>

12:46.660 --> 12:49.200
Treat me to a tasty meal!

12:49.490 --> 12:52.540
That'll shut my trap, feel me?

12:57.710 --> 13:00.380
<i>Participate in the Holy Grail War...</i>

13:01.550 --> 13:03.470
<i>Ayaka Sajyou.</i>

13:04.680 --> 13:05.680
<i>If you flee...</i>

13:06.590 --> 13:08.760
<i>the curse will...</i>

13:09.640 --> 13:10.970
<i>devour your life.</i>

13:17.440 --> 13:18.270
What...

13:18.610 --> 13:19.690
is this?

13:20.650 --> 13:22.940
If you thought you were hiding...

13:23.320 --> 13:25.780
you have quite underestimated me.

13:28.030 --> 13:31.080
That mark is no Command Spell.

13:31.450 --> 13:33.500
For what purpose have you come to this town?

13:34.250 --> 13:35.790
I don't know.

13:36.170 --> 13:41.590
I was just told by some strange woman
in white to come here.

13:41.590 --> 13:43.510
I see.

13:43.510 --> 13:46.550
A poor little rogue Mage
made into a sacrificial pawn...

13:47.380 --> 13:50.510
by that Einzbern meat puppet.

13:51.100 --> 13:53.270
I'm not a Mage, though.

13:54.100 --> 13:57.390
Sorry to say, but you're going to
have to stick around for a bit longer.

13:57.980 --> 14:00.610
My client loves to play around.

14:01.020 --> 14:01.940
Huh?

14:02.360 --> 14:05.150
Oh, it's only a test.

14:05.650 --> 14:08.030
On whether the Servant we will now summon...

14:08.030 --> 14:12.950
a noble hero once dubbed
the King of the Knights of the Round Table...

14:13.740 --> 14:17.580
would obey an order...

14:18.210 --> 14:20.420
to slay a defenseless woman.

14:24.210 --> 14:26.090
<i>For the elements, silver and iron.</i>

14:26.090 --> 14:28.970
<i>For the foundation, stone
and the Archduke of Pacts.</i>

14:28.970 --> 14:32.850
<i>Raise a wall for the wind that shall fall.
Close the gates of the four directions.</i>

14:29.930 --> 14:32.850
<i>So, this is my destiny.</i>

14:33.640 --> 14:36.730
<i>Or is it her curse?</i>

14:38.190 --> 14:39.900
<i>If so...</i>

14:39.900 --> 14:41.860
<i>will she be satisfied with this?</i>

14:47.780 --> 14:48.820
<i>No.</i>

14:49.450 --> 14:51.030
<i>I don't want to die!</i>

14:51.820 --> 14:52.490
Huh?

14:52.830 --> 14:55.040
<i>Come forth from the circle of binding...</i>

14:55.040 --> 14:57.120
<i>Guardian of the...</i>

14:58.460 --> 14:59.290
<i>Scales...</i>

15:00.790 --> 15:02.540
<i>Zabaniya.</i>

15:01.130 --> 15:01.380
ZABANIYA

15:02.130 --> 15:02.540
ZABANIYA

15:11.010 --> 15:13.760
Wh-What?

15:16.220 --> 15:18.020
Wh-Why...

15:18.640 --> 15:20.770
is she here?

15:28.610 --> 15:32.910
Are you a Mage seeking the Holy Grail?

15:33.410 --> 15:34.160
I...

15:34.830 --> 15:35.870
I'm...

15:53.180 --> 15:56.390
What will she do? What will she do?

15:56.390 --> 15:57.060
Altry!

15:57.720 --> 16:00.770
To see your Master dead
the instant you were summoned...

16:01.390 --> 16:03.940
It's quite dramatic, isn't it?

16:05.060 --> 16:05.900
Huh?

16:06.860 --> 16:08.320
Huh?

16:09.320 --> 16:10.900
That Saber...

16:11.780 --> 16:12.490
Who is that?

16:17.280 --> 16:18.620
My oh my.

16:19.790 --> 16:22.460
This appears to be a bit of a strange situation.

16:23.870 --> 16:26.420
Not even one word of welcome.

16:28.300 --> 16:29.300
Hmph.

16:29.670 --> 16:32.340
That guise, that flow of power...

16:32.340 --> 16:35.890
Perhaps, you are associated
with the Old Man of the Mountain?

16:41.520 --> 16:42.430
Quite amazing!

16:43.060 --> 16:45.690
This is the first time I've seen
someone more nimble than Loxley!

16:50.900 --> 16:52.610
She's gone?

17:01.410 --> 17:03.750
Dissatisfied with the comparison?

17:04.960 --> 17:05.830
But still...

17:06.170 --> 17:08.670
quite a magnificent demonstration of skill.

17:13.300 --> 17:15.930
<i>Excalibur!</i>

17:35.740 --> 17:36.740
Hmph...

17:37.160 --> 17:38.870
To manage an escape from me...

17:43.250 --> 17:44.250
I ask you.

17:45.330 --> 17:47.420
Are you my Master?

17:51.210 --> 17:52.340
I am not.

17:54.970 --> 17:56.050
I will no longer...

17:58.760 --> 18:01.220
be what you all want me to be!

18:02.350 --> 18:05.600
Please just leave me alone.

18:09.020 --> 18:10.310
Freeze!

18:11.150 --> 18:13.940
Both hands behind your head and lie face down!

18:15.240 --> 18:19.910
You're under arrest for unlawful entry and
suspicion of terrorism via destruction of property!

18:21.780 --> 18:26.540
<i>I am here in downtown in front of the Opera House,
where a part of the building has collapsed.</i>

18:27.040 --> 18:29.920
<i>What could have happened to this building...</i>

18:30.500 --> 18:33.250
<i>with over 50 years of history?</i>

18:33.960 --> 18:36.130
<i>The police have exited the building!</i>

18:36.510 --> 18:37.300
<i>Are you watching?</i>

18:37.300 --> 18:40.180
<i>It appears they have someone in custody!</i>

18:43.180 --> 18:49.350
There's no doubt that the explosion
was from the summoned Saber? Yes.

18:50.190 --> 18:51.980
Wh-What are you doing?

18:50.600 --> 18:53.020
Oh! Just now, a man has walked
past the police officers...

18:53.480 --> 18:58.110
Then, this case is an accident where the paint
used for the renovation caught fire...

18:58.570 --> 18:59.280
and...

19:00.570 --> 19:02.490
<i>Listen, citizens!</i>

19:03.490 --> 19:06.080
That I have destroyed an opera house...

19:06.080 --> 19:09.460
a sacrosanct location
and the home to song and stage...

19:09.460 --> 19:11.290
fills me with shame!

19:12.380 --> 19:14.340
It was all due to my carelessness!

19:14.750 --> 19:15.880
I have no excuse!

19:16.460 --> 19:17.170
However...

19:18.130 --> 19:20.380
in lieu of that, I instead propose a promise!

19:21.510 --> 19:25.220
I swear upon the great foundation
of my chivalry, Arthur Pendragon...

19:26.020 --> 19:30.520
and the victory songs of great knights
echoing throughout my homeland!

19:31.310 --> 19:36.940
I will be sure to make up for the destruction
of this opera house on my honor!

19:38.690 --> 19:42.160
With this, concealing anything
is out of the question.

19:42.410 --> 19:43.620
So, all of this...

19:44.330 --> 19:48.700
was part of your plan, Ms. Francesca?

19:51.540 --> 19:53.710
Unexpected! So unexpected!

19:54.130 --> 19:56.590
This was completely unexpected!

19:58.090 --> 20:00.880
Oh no, my pancreas and spleen
are gonna get twisted!

20:02.510 --> 20:06.510
I've seen several Holy Grail Wars to date...

20:06.510 --> 20:11.350
but this is definitely the first time
I've seen a Servant apprehended by the police!

20:12.020 --> 20:14.060
Because things like this happen...

20:14.360 --> 20:18.070
you just can't stop living!

20:18.480 --> 20:20.570
My thanks for your attention!

20:21.070 --> 20:22.990
I pray your lives are filled...

20:22.990 --> 20:26.580
with the glory of song!

22:58.690 --> 23:00.230
Um...

23:00.230 --> 23:03.360
Are you listening, Hansa?

23:03.860 --> 23:07.490
Rest assured, I am listening.
But give no heed...

23:07.950 --> 23:09.160
Father.

23:09.950 --> 23:12.580
Giving no heed is bad though. Yeah.

23:13.280 --> 23:17.790
Father, you simply need to relay
the will of God to me...

23:18.660 --> 23:20.960
to eradicate the enemy.

23:21.330 --> 23:28.590
I told you, our job isn't to be an Executor this time,
but a supervisor role in a Holy Grail War.

23:29.090 --> 23:31.050
You see, if it comes to fighting...

23:31.430 --> 23:35.100
you're just slightly better than I am, right?

23:35.470 --> 23:36.220
You know...

23:36.600 --> 23:41.350
when listening to what others say,
you should put the cellphone down, okay?

23:42.190 --> 23:43.360
You, too, Father.

23:43.980 --> 23:46.980
When you speak to someone,
please look them in the eye.

23:47.360 --> 23:48.440
Also...

23:48.860 --> 23:53.620
at least superficially, your speech and behavior
should be suitable for a priest.

23:53.620 --> 23:55.030
Understood?

23:55.660 --> 23:57.580
Of course I understand.

23:57.870 --> 24:02.000
I will make sure to wear street clothes
when I head over to the casino.

24:02.420 --> 24:06.500
I'd prefer you refrain
from a casino trip to begin with.

24:16.260 --> 24:18.020
Oh, sorry.

24:18.020 --> 24:22.600
I thought your skills have gotten rusty
since getting hooked on that cellphone.

24:24.020 --> 24:25.270
As for fighting...

24:26.190 --> 24:29.940
you still have quite the knack for it, Father.

24:32.400 --> 24:34.870
Now, let us head out, Quartet.

24:35.700 --> 24:38.290
It's our first job in quite a while.

24:38.290 --> 24:39.910
EPISODE 1
